WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
but not an ethnic one.

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.240
Because that area requires a lot of cleansing.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.440
Because when you have a population

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.800
that was taught from early childhood age

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.400
to hate Jews, Christians, and pagans,

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.320
you need some serious re-education.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.160
Number one, that's not true,

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.200
and number two, that's not what he's proposing.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.760
Well, I mean, most Palestinians, by polling number,

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.799
do support Hamas.

00:00:18.799 --> 00:00:20.600
They support resisting Israel.

